OL,3,GNEWSAEasyJet to stop flying from Leeds
OL,4,ABradford Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FEasyJet will cease running flights from
OL,7,FLeeds Bradford Airport (LBA) next
OL,8,FJanuary, the airline has confirmed.
OL,10,FThe operator, which offered journeys to
OL,11,FBarcelona, Paris, Belfast, Malaga,
OL,12,FMallorca and Geneva,  said it was
OL,13,Fwithdrawing from the airport to "focus
OL,14,Fon maintaining and developing" its
OL,15,F"most popular" routes.
OL,17,FCustomers with EasyJet bookings from
OL,18,FLBA beyond 5 January next year have
OL,19,Fbeen offered a free transfer to flights
OL,20,Ffrom an alternative airport or a
OL,21,Frefund, the operator added.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
